{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposal by reason of poor quality outlook and lack of\r\nlight and ventilation to bedrooms of the first floor flats, unacceptable\r\nvertical stacking of different room types between\r\nflats&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;inadequate provision of external private amenity space,\r\nwould create a cramped and poor standard of living accommodation for future\r\noccupiers to the detriment of their residential amenity. Additionally, the\r\nmixed commercial/residential access would give rise to poor security for future\r\noccupiers. The proposal would therefore be contrary to the National Planning\r\nPolicy Framework (2023), Policy D3.D(7), D6 and D11 of The London Plan (2021),\r\nCore Policy CS1 (B) and CS1 (K) of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), policies\r\nDM1 and DM26 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013)\r\nand the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide\r\n(2010).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed development fails to provide appropriate\r\ncovered and secure cycle parking and waste storage, and has not identified\r\nsufficient space within the site where such provision could be made. The\r\ndevelopment is therefore contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of The\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2023), policies T5 and D6.E of The London\r\nPlan (2021), policies CS1.B, CS1.R and CS1.X of the Harrow Core Strategy\r\n(2012), Policy AAP19 of the Harrow and Wealdstone Area Action Plan (2013) and policies\r\nDM1, DM42 and DM45 The Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
